Spelling dictionaries
---------------------
Insanity_Loom ships with the compiled spelling dictionary Chromium itself uses for English
(en-US), fetched at build time from Chromium's own dictionary service. That dictionary is
derived from SCOWL and is distributed by the Chromium project under its own terms; it is
included here unchanged. Dictionaries for other languages are not shipped, and are fetched
only if the author turns that on (Edit > Preferences).
